{title: Dos Puntas}
{key: C}
{time: 6/8}
{meta: rhythm Cuenca}
{meta: source Tunabundel – Tuna Ciudad de Luz}

{comment: Intro}
| [C] | . | . | [G7] | . | [C] | . | [G7] |
| . | [C] | . | [G7] | . | [C] | [*FEm] | [Dm] |
| [G7] | [C] | [C] | [C] |

{start_of_verse: Couplet 1}
[C]Cuando pa Chile me [G7]voy
cruzando la cordi[C]llera,
sidenote2x [F]late el cor[Em]azón con[Dm]tento
[G7]una Chilena me esp[C]era. sidenote
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Couplet 2}
[C]Y cuando vuelvo de [G7]Chile
entre cerros y que[C]bradas
sidenote2x [F]late el cor[Em]azón con[Dm]tento
[G7]pues me espera una cu[C]yana. sidenote
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Brug}
[D7]Viva la chicha y el [G]vino
viva la [D7]cueca y la zam[G7]ba...
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrein}
sidenote2x Dos [F]puntas tiene el ca[C]mino
y en las dos [G7]alguien me a[C]guarda. sidenote
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Intermezzo}
| [G7] | . | [C] | . | [G7] | . | [C] | . |
| [G7] | . | [C] | [*FEm] | [Dm] | [G7] | [C] | [C] |
| [C] |

{start_of_verse: Couplet 3}
[C]Yo bailo la cueca en [G7]Chile
y en Cuyo bailo la [C]zamba.
sidenote2x [F]En Chile [Em]con las chi[Dm]lenas,
[G7]Con la otra en Calin[C]gasta sidenote
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Couplet 4}
[C]Vida triste, vida a[G7]legre,
Eso es la vida del ar[C]riero.
sidenote2x [F]Penitas [Em]en el ca[Dm]mino,
[G7]risas al fin del sen[C]dero. sidenote
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Brug (repetir)}

{chorus: Refrein met einde:}

{start_of_verse: Fin}
al[G7]guien me [C] a[G7]guar[C]da [G7] [G]
{end_of_verse}
